{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05894","headline":"早入荥阳界 · 王维","name":"早入荥阳界","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泛舟入荥泽，兹邑乃雄藩。\n河曲闾阎隘，川中烟火繁。\n因人见风俗，入境闻方言。\n秋野田畴盛，朝光市井喧。\n渔商波上客，鸡犬岸旁村。\n前路白云外，孤帆安可论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05894.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05894","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}